<title>USA: Equitable to buy Energy Department pipeline.</title>
<headline>Equitable to buy Energy Department pipeline.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equitable Resources Inc said Tuesday it is moving forward with the acquistion of the U.S. Department of Energy's 67 mile pipeline in southern Louisiana for $22 million.</p>
<p>Upon completion of the acquisition, expected May 1, the crude oil pipeline will be converted to a high pressure natural gas pipeline and is expected to be in full operation by July 1, Equitable said.</p>
